docs(nature-round): amend C so the NMR arm reads the published instruments

Recorded after the real C result (UNRESOLVED) was read, at the author's
instruction, and before the change is implemented or rerun. The NMR arm failed
its control because it reselected instruments; Table oS3b came from
exports/agent1/nmr_gencov/nmr_mvmr_snps.csv, so the arm will read that file
(CARDIoGRAM only: the file has no alleles). Verdict rule unchanged.

Prediction written here before the rerun: on the published estimates the NMR
contrast is about -1.28, opposite to the biochemistry arm, so the label is
expected to stay UNRESOLVED (disagreement across arms), not become CONTRADICTS.

